  DisplayName: Lisbon Remembers the Age of Discovery
  EventType: 1
  Description: Lisbon {is holding|will hold} an exhibition in honour of its navigators,
    with charts, tiles and treasures brought out of the old houses. The age of the
    caravels {has caught|will catch} the fancy of collectors, and a few families
    {are offering|will offer} pieces quietly to the trade.
